<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Sell Technology | TechFoundX</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="marketplace-portal.css">
</head>
<body>

<header class="portal-header">
  <a class="brand" href="marketplace.html">
    <img src="assets/logo.PNG" alt="TechFoundX">
    <div>
      <strong>TechFoundX</strong>
      <span>Technology Marketplace</span>
    </div>
  </a>
</header>

<main class="portal-main">
  <span class="eyebrow">SELL / LIST TECHNOLOGY</span>
  <h1>Bring your technology to the marketplace.</h1>

  <p class="portal-intro">
    Create a professional technology listing, provide commercial and
    ownership information, complete verification and submit your product
    for marketplace publication.
  </p>

  <div class="portal-actions">
    <a class="primary" href="marketplace.html">Seller Registration</a>
    <a href="marketplace.html">Marketplace Home</a>
  </div>

  <section class="portal-section">
    <h2>Seller Area</h2>

    <div class="portal-grid">
      <article class="portal-card">
        <span class="meta">01</span>
        <h3>My Products</h3>
        <p>Manage your technology products and listings.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="portal-card">
        <span class="meta">02</span>
        <h3>Create Listing</h3>
        <p>Add technology identity, features, business information and commercial terms.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="portal-card">
        <span class="meta">03</span>
        <h3>Verification</h3>
        <p>Submit ownership, technology and supporting information for review.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

<footer class="portal-footer">
  <strong>TechFoundX</strong>
  <span>Global Technology Marketplace</span>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
